                        "entry_id": "1c90b287-416c-3bd2-8a12-63197960dbe3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Jamaican Patois, a Jamaican creole language based primarily on English and African languages but also having influences from Spanish, Portuguese, and Hindi."
